  "steps": [
    {
      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Order reagents and prepare media",
      "instruction": "Order all required reagents and consumables for yeast culturing as listed in the key resources table. Prepare all necessary media components according to the materials and equipment setup. Ensure standard laboratory equipment is available; a microtiter plate reader with shaking and temperature control is recommended for the immunity assay, though individual culture tubes can be used. For the spot (serial dilution) assay, confirm that toxin expression is inducible (or plan to repress activity by pH or temperature).",
