    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Set incubation conditions",
      "instruction": "Use buffered media for all assays. Incubate cultures at the appropriate temperature (25 °C or 30 °C) depending on toxin activity. Adjust pH as required for toxin activation. Employ a galactose‑inducible promoter to switch toxin expression on or off.",
